{"kind": "mod", "id": 1651, "name": "Borkel's Crye Multicam", "slug": "borkels-crye-multicam", "teaser": "For now it just replaces the default USEC clothing set or the boring USEC AC Ranger Green clothing set with a cool multicam set, but in the future I plan on it being a separate clothing set.", "owner_name": "Borkel", "downloads": 2595, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "Creative Commons BY-NC-SA 3.0", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:59:00.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-08-13T13:50:14.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-08-13T13:50:14.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.9.0", "latest_version": "1.0.2", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/legalcode", "description_html": "<p><strong>OLD, WILL NOT BE MANTAINED. <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2328-borkel-s-crye-camo-pack/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">USE THIS INSTEAD</a>.</strong></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Quick Preview</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>I originally used textures from <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/951-multicam-gear-and-clothing/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MultiCam Gear and Clothing</a>, so thanks to <strong>FALmonsta</strong>, but it now uses assets from the <strong>MILF Modding Group</strong>, also thanks to <strong>Snuffpuppy</strong> for the assets.</p>\n<p>The old multicam replacer will not be mantained, this is where I’ll post any clothing sets I make.</p>\n<p>Preview:</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j0jIEzK.png\" alt=\"j0jIEzK.png\" /></p>\n<p>This one is from the old version:</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uL76x5e.png\" alt=\"uL76x5e.png\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>The mod contains two folders, one to replace the default USEC clothing and one to replace the USEC AC Ranger Green set. Open one of the folders and drag its content into the SPT fodler.</p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1523, "published_at": "2024-08-18T10:15:49.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1651/borkels-crye-multicam/1.0.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "repos": [], "source_code_links": [], "required_by": 0, "no_repo": true, "obtainable": false, "dep_problems": 0}